For 3 rounds, melee attacks by the Riftblade deal an additional magic damage and slow hit targets by 25%.
3rd level: +1d6 magic damage
8th level: +2d4 magic damage
13th level: +2d6 magic damage~

@1114 = ~Distortion Field~
@1115 = ~Distortion Field:
